sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If two numbers multiplied by one another make certain numbers, then the numbers so produced equal one another.
----
proof:

Let {A} and {B} be two numbers, and let {A} multiplied by {B} make {C}, and {B} multiplied by {A} make {D}.

I say that {C} equals {D}.

